 "provenance": "Tibet 4 (world 2, level 3) normal exit 33,3, control-only from spawn on the exact S700 core. Start values: weaponTier 2 (Tibet 1-6 start with the hook: choosing Tibet on the seal grants tier >= 2, cGame.method_75), maxHealth 4 (no armour bought; the Tibet seal does not raise it) and lives 12; the route takes one hit (health 3 at the exit). No deaths, no resets. Route: hook the weight 9,9 so the weight column collapses and the stones blocking 9,6 drop; cut grass 10,6, checkpoint 18,6. Collect 21,7/20,7, hook weight 19,7 to 20,7 and push it to 21,7; its column lifts stone 22,6 (hooked into 21,6) to 21,2; pushed left it falls onto plate 20,4 and opens gate 23,4. Down past the shooters to checkpoint 13,14. Room: hook weight 13,19 to 11,19 and 9,19 (column 9), hook stone 7,16 into the column, push it off the top so it rests at 10,16; move the weight to 12,19 (hook + push), hook the stone into column 12 and push it off the top onto plate 13,17 (gate 15,16). One hammer hit clears the brick field; through checkpoints 30,25 and 22,30. Cut grass 20,29, walk under stone 22,32 through grass 22,33, hammer grass 23,33 so stone 23,32 drops, push it onto plate 26,34 (gate 29,34); push the other stone into the weight column 20 (rises to 20,29). Gold key chest 31,34, gold lock 32,25 opens gate 32,26; up the east shaft (health chest 35,21) to 32,5, through grass 31,5, push stone 30,5 into weight column 29 (rises to 29,2), push it off at 30,2 so it falls onto plate 28,4 (gate 31,3), exit 33,3. The 50-diamond magic lock at 32,3 does not block in S700 1.2.0 (its tile is cleared at map load, cGame map scan case 12).",
